{"type":"message","id":"d6e2da72","parentId":"9ac10fa0","timestamp":"2026-03-18T15:00:07.252Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_8---d6c1678b-b3f5-4fca-9877-ace7907d3a8d.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_8---d6c1678b-b3f5-4fca-9877-ace7907d3a8d.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"440\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"sender\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-18 15:00 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Matteo Cicalese (495506013)\",\n  \"id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"name\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"username\": \"CicaMatt\"\n}\n```\n\nrun the kidney cancer detection pipeline on this image file. i'd like also that you save in the workspace both the final raw request sent and the obtained raw response, as separate files"},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/jpeg"}],"timestamp":1773846007249}}
