 alteration.\n\n**X-AI module**\n- Confidence interpretation: very high confidence reported, but still **not a definitive diagnostic tool**\n- Summary: the returned text says the image suggests a high likelihood of kidney cancer and points to a kidney tumor\n- Recommended next steps:\n  1. Further medical evaluation with imaging/labs\n  2. Consultation with a medical professional\n  3. Consider additional diagnostic testing such as biopsy or genetic testing\n\n### Important note\nThis is again a **prototype pipeline result and only a preliminary signal**, not a diagnosis.\n\nIf you want, I can now compare **scan 1 vs scan 2** side by side, or produce a cleaner distilled report for both together.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_03718ef5fe8dc7d90169babee1d940819193fb252fb9f3e2e2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9158,"output":360,"cacheRead":36352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45870,"cost":{"input":0.022895000000000002,"output":0.0054,"cacheRead":0.009087999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037383}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773846236849}}
